  "slides": [
    "\n  <span class=\"slide-num\">01 / 05</span>\n  <span class=\"slide-label\">Report #01</span>\n  <div class=\"date-badge\">17 Jun 2016</div>\n  <div class=\"value\">US$ 60M</div>\n  <div class=\"hack-name\">The DAO</div>\n  <div class=\"headline\">\"O hack que dividiu o Ethereum ao meio\"</div>\n  <span class=\"severity-tag severity-critical\">REENTRANCY · CRITICAL</span>\n  <p style=\"margin-top:24px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.4);font-size:15px\">3,6 milhões de ETH drenados em uma única transação</p>\n  <div class=\"branding\"><span>Solbook · <span class=\"author-name\">Lucas Oliveira</span></span><span>linkedin.com/in/olivmath</span></div>\n",
    "\n  <span class=\"slide-num\">02 / 05</span>\n  <span class=\"slide-label\">A História</span>\n  <div class=\"section-title\">O que aconteceu</div>\n  <div class=\"story-text\">\n    <strong>The DAO</strong> era o maior fundo de investimento descentralizado da história em 2016 — arrecadou <em>US$ 150 milhões</em> em ETH em apenas 28 dias.\n    <br><br>\n    A ideia era simples: qualquer pessoa podia propor projetos e os investidores votavam. Quem discordasse podia sair via a função <em>splitDAO</em>, recebendo seu ETH de volta.\n    <br><br>\n    Um atacante descobriu que a função <strong>fazia a transferência antes de zerar o saldo</strong>. Com um contrato malicioso no fallback, ele <em>reentrava</em> na função e sacava repetidamente.\n    <br><br>\n    O Ethereum fez um <strong>hard fork</strong> para reverter o roubo — criando o Ethereum Classic (ETC) como a chain original.\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"branding\"><span>Solbook · <span class=\"author-name\">Lucas Oliveira</span></span><span>linkedin.com/in/olivmath</span></div>\n",
    "\n  <span class=\"slide-num\">03 / 05</span>\n  <span class=\"slide-label\">O Código</span>\n  <div class=\"section-title\">Contrato Vulnerável</div>\n  <div class=\"editor-mockup\">\n    <div class=\"editor-sidebar\">\n      <div class=\"editor-file active\">TheDAO.sol</div>\n      <div class=\"editor-file\">Attacker.sol</div>\n    </div>\n    <code class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-inner\"><div class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"kw\">function</span> <span class=\"fn\">splitDAO</span>(<span class=\"tp\">uint</span> _proposalID) {</div><div class=\"code-line\"></div><div class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"cmt\">// 1. Calcula saldo do investidor</span></div><div class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"tp\">uint</span> balance <span class=\"op\">=</span> balances[<span class=\"var\">msg.sender</span>];</div><div class=\"code-line\"></div><div class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"cmt\">// 2. Envia ETH ANTES de zerar</span></div><div class=\"code-line vuln-line\">    <span class=\"var\">msg.sender</span>.<span class=\"fn\">call</span>.<span class=\"fn\">value</span>(balance)(<span class=\"str\">\"\"</span>);</div><div class=\"code-line\"></div><div class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"cmt\">// 3. Zera saldo DEPOIS (tarde demais)</span></div><div class=\"code-line\">    balances[<span class=\"var\">msg.sender</span>] <span class=\"op\">=</span> <span class=\"num\">0</span>;</div><div class=\"code-line\">}</div><div class=\"code-line\"></div><div class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"cmt\">// O fallback do atacante:</span></div><div class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"kw\">fallback</span>() <span class=\"kw\">external</span> <span class=\"kw\">payable</span> {</div><div class=\"code-line\">    dao.<span class=\"fn\">splitDAO</span>(proposalID); <span class=\"cmt\">// reentra!</span></div><div class=\"code-line\">}</div></div></code>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"lesson-box\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">\n    <div class=\"lesson-label\">LIÇÃO</div>\n    <p>Atualize o estado <strong>antes</strong> de qualquer chamada externa: <span class=\"lime\">Checks → Effects → Interactions</span></p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"branding\"><span>Solbook · <span class=\"author-name\">Lucas Oliveira</span></span><span>linkedin.com/in/olivmath</span></div>\n",
    "\n  <span class=\"slide-num\">04 / 05</span>\n  <span class=\"slide-label\">Análise Técnica</span>\n  <div class=\"section-title\">Como o ataque funcionou</div>\n  <div class=\"flow-diagram\">\n    <div class=\"flow-card flow-card--normal\">\n      <div class=\"flow-card__step\">01</div>\n      <div class=\"flow-card__text\">Atacante deposita<br>ETH no DAO</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flow-arrow\">→</div>\n    <div class=\"flow-card flow-card--normal\">\n      <div class=\"flow-card__step\">02</div>\n      <div class=\"flow-card__text\">Chama <span class=\"lime\">splitDAO()</span><br>para sacar</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flow-arrow\">→</div>\n    <div class=\"flow-card flow-card--danger\">\n      <div class=\"flow-card__step\">03</div>\n      <div class=\"flow-card__text\">DAO envia ETH via<br><span class=\"danger\">call.value()</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flow-arrow flow-arrow--down\">↓</div>\n    <div class=\"flow-card flow-card--danger\">\n      <div class=\"flow-card__step\">06</div>\n      <div class=\"flow-card__text\">Saldo não zerado<br><span class=\"danger\">saca de novo!</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flow-arrow flow-arrow--reverse\">←</div>\n    <div class=\"flow-card flow-card--danger\">\n      <div class=\"flow-card__step\">05</div>\n      <div class=\"flow-card__text\"><span class=\"danger\">fallback()</span> chama<br><span class=\"danger\">splitDAO()</span> de novo</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flow-arrow flow-arrow--reverse\">←</div>\n    <div class=\"flow-card flow-card--normal\">\n      <div class=\"flow-card__step\">04</div>\n      <div class=\"flow-card__text\"><span class=\"lime\">fallback()</span> do<br>atacante é acionado</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flow-loop\">\n      <div class=\"flow-loop__icon\">↻</div>\n      <div class=\"flow-loop__text\">LOOP INFINITO — repete até drenar o contrato</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"branding\"><span>Solbook · <span class=\"author-name\">Lucas Oliveira</span></span><span>linkedin.com/in/olivmath</span></div>\n",
